  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposed ground-level skylight, by virtue of its scale and siting, would provide for an out of character addition which appears at odds with the character of the host property. This together with the large projection of the basement extension would add to a sense of overdevelopment of the plot, which would cause harm to the character and appearance of the property and wider streetscene. It is therefore contrary to the objectives of Policy 53 of the adopted Waltham Forest Local Plan LP1 (2024).&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposed basement extension, by virtue of its siting, would be situated within the root protection area of a mature street tree which provides a positive contribution in terms of visual amenity and biodiversity. The basement-level development would cause harm to its setting and further harm cannot be ruled out. This is contrary to the objectives of Policy 80 of the adopted Waltham Forest Local Plan LP1 (2024), which looks to retain and protect existing trees.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
